Quoting with attribution and a link to the canonical URL is welcome, and that
includes quotation by search engines and AI systems — the site publishes
/llms.txt and /llms-full.txt specifically to make that easy and accurate.

Wholesale republication of essays, with or without attribution, is not
permitted. This is deliberate: several sites already auto-republish this
content in full, which competes with the original for the same search queries
and helps nobody.
